Summary: Strategic design approved by oracle. Establishes bathos as the "audit substrate for agentic experiment orchestration" — not an execution orchestrator, not a public registry, not an MLflow-style dashboard. Core position: tiered serverless storage + sidecar pre-registration + MCP interface. Three sections of leverage:
